  "wants_video": false,
  "ig_caption": "Everyone's obsessed with tool count.\n\nBut here's the thing: 15 disconnected apps = chaos.\n\nOne integrated stack = automation that actually works.\n\nYou don't need 47 SaaS subscriptions.\n\nYou need a brain that connects them.\n\nWe built ours with Claude + N8N + GoHighLevel + Google Workspace.\n\nClean. Simple. Scalable.\n\nStill juggling disconnected tools?\n\n#AIAutomation #Accelod #ClaudeAI #N8N #GoHighLevel #BusinessAutomation #Entrepreneur #WorkflowAutomation #AIAgents #SmallBusinessOwner #NoCode #SaaS #Solopreneur #DigitalTransformation #TechStack #ScaleYourBusiness #AITools #MarketingAutomation #ProductivityHacks #FutureOfWork #Automation #RemoteWork #SystemsThinking #BuildInPublic #GrowthHacking",
  "fb_caption": "Here's what nobody talks about: more tools don't equal better automation.\n\nWe tested the myth. Turns out, 15 disconnected apps create more problems than they solve.\n\nBut one integrated stack? That's where the magic happens.\n\nClaude + N8N + GoHighLevel + Google Workspace. Clean. Connected. Scalable.\n\nYou don't need 47 SaaS subscriptions. You need integration and workflow design.\n\nWhat's your current tool stack looking like?\n\n#AIAutomation #Accelod #BusinessAutomation #WorkflowAutomation",
